  "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
  "body": "**Original comment by Paul Matthijsse (Bitbucket: [Paul Matthijsse](https://bitbucket.org/Paul Matthijsse), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nHello Alberto, I read on [pixls.us](http://pixls.us) that you changed Log Encoding into Log Tone Mapping. We must find a way to inform translators about these kind of changes, as it is impossible to check all those ~2000 lines of the default file every day! \n\nI propose to add new/changed language strings at the end of default, with a # in front of it, or just add a new line above a string that has changed. \n\nRegards, Paul.\n",
